%%{init: {"sequence": {"noteAlign": "left", "mirrorActors": false}} }%%
%% docs/diagrams/scenario-s2.mermaid
%% S2: Host -> Aggregator-T1 -> Aggregator-T2 -> S3 (final)
%% PLAN.md §2 (scenario table), §5.1 (timestamps), §5.2 (derivation).
sequenceDiagram
    participant generator as Generator
    participant agent as Agent: Vector or Cribl Edge
    participant T1 as Aggregator T1: llt-vagg-t1-nlb :8080 / llt-cs-t1-nlb :8080
    participant T2 as Aggregator T2: llt-vagg-t2-nlb :8081 / llt-cs-t2-nlb :8081
    participant final as Final S3: llt-final-{acct}

    generator->>generator: write event file<br/>t_gen_ns (generation time)
    generator->>agent: event file (local read)
    Note over agent: hop_ts.agent captured here —<br/>BEFORE any egress (incl. S3 landing write)
    agent->>T1: HTTP/1.1 POST NDJSON<br/>via PrivateLink interface endpoint<br/>(llt-sender-vagg-ep / llt-sender-cs-ep)<br/>:8080, TLS off
    Note over T1: hop_ts.agg1 captured here<br/>(VRL remap / Cribl Eval on receive)
    T1->>T2: HTTP/1.1 POST NDJSON<br/>intra-VPC via Tier-2 NLB<br/>:8081, TLS off, 1s batch
    Note over T2: hop_ts.agg2 captured here<br/>(VRL remap / Cribl Eval on receive,<br/>S2/S4 only)
    T2->>final: S3 sink PutObject<br/>batch 5s / 10MB
    Note over final: final PutObject time captured<br/>(x-amz-meta-llt-put-ms preferred,<br/>LastModified fallback — fallback operative)

    Note over generator,final: Derivations (PLAN §5.2):<br/>gen→agent = hop_ts.agent − t_gen<br/>agent→T1 = hop_ts.agg1 − hop_ts.agent<br/>T1→T2 = hop_ts.agg2 − hop_ts.agg1<br/>T2→final = finalPut − hop_ts.agg2<br/>e2e = finalPut − t_gen
